<p>For the next <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns, you recover <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">29, 39, 46, 53, 59</acronym> life and talents without fixed cooldowns will have their cooldowns refresh twice as fast as usual.</p><p>The life regeneration will scale with your Spellpower.</p>